# Doom II MAP20 (T10.6): started beside line 300 (special 83, tag 16), on its
# front, the player walks across it, then waits for the movers it set going
# (at most 450 tics). Written by tools/RouteGen (map20-line300).
iwad doom2
map MAP20
start 3488 160 270

# forwardmove sidemove turn buttons [xcount]; turn << 8 = angleturn
0 0 0 0
25 0 0 0
0 0 0 0 x11
